    description: "DEEP bakeoff assessment found that JSX Route nodes detected by the new React Router detection (PR #2127) have zero outgoing edges. Forward slices from route entrypoints are completely empty. Need to emit renders_component or calls edges from Route nodes to their handler components. Affects: hubs, element-call, snapshot-v1, and any React Router app. This is the single highest-impact fix for SPA codebase usefulness."  # 6c75
